Cell[TextData[StyleBox["0.  USER KNOB  Defines scenario, forcing, and run \
controls. ",
 FontSize->16,
 FontWeight->"Bold",
 FontColor->RGBColor[0.6, 0.4, 0.2]]], "Subtitle",
 CellFrame->{{0, 0}, {0.5, 0.5}},
 CellFrameColor->GrayLevel[0],
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9316978235922947`*^9, 3.9316978308224087`*^9}, {
   3.931754486545412*^9, 3.931754545732315*^9}, {3.9317581231118126`*^9, 
   3.931758125783575*^9}, {3.9317700222803783`*^9, 3.9317700263323917`*^9}, {
   3.9317704368845177`*^9, 3.9317704385617523`*^9}, {3.931770772415556*^9, 
   3.931770785692173*^9}, {3.9317709826154556`*^9, 3.9317710101470394`*^9}, 
   3.9317718408597984`*^9, 3.936178864075368*^9, 3.9768584077417164`*^9, {
   3.977541292703079*^9, 3.977541321663677*^9}},
 FontSize->18,
 FontWeight->Bold,
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.91, 0.88],ExpressionUUID->"ccc2da68-8150-b64d-9f63-947d890a7c91"],

Cell["\<\
This section defines all user-controlled parameters and performs basic \
consistency checks before any model execution. It clears the global namespace \
to ensure a clean run, sets the mean light intensity and modulation \
amplitude, and specifies the list of forcing periods \|01d447 used in the \
parameter sweep. A default period is assigned for initialization but is \
overwritten during looping.
Numerical controls define the maximum number of forcing periods simulated, \
the number of final cycles retained for plotting and export, the convergence \
metric used to detect steady periodic behavior, and the initialization mode \
for the system state. The light forcing is implemented analytically as a \
sinusoidal function with period \|01d447, evaluated dynamically so that each \
sweep iteration uses the correct forcing.
The output directory is created if necessary, and input validation aborts \
execution if nonphysical or inconsistent parameters are detected. A final \
sanity check reports the resulting light intensity range and warns if \
negative values occur.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9777982319087715`*^9, 3.977798279828615*^9}, {
  4.001393213177803*^9, 
  4.001393217613394*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0991cfa9-e520-894f-a8d3-\
ceb506df1684"],

