Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["III.2 Period-chunked Poincar\[EAcute] integration",
 FontSize->16,
 FontWeight->"Bold",
 FontColor->RGBColor[
  0.7803921568627451, 0.4235294117647059, 0.1607843137254902]]], "Subsection",
 CellFrame->{{0, 0}, {0.5, 0.5}},
 CellFrameColor->RGBColor[0.6, 0.4, 0.2],
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9316167181482306`*^9, 3.931616725207141*^9}, 
   3.9316172604007163`*^9, {3.931617329225854*^9, 3.931617331570511*^9}, {
   3.931618560961228*^9, 3.931618561886388*^9}, {3.931758655571293*^9, 
   3.9317586654545097`*^9}, {3.9317587010901165`*^9, 3.931758757425419*^9}, {
   3.931759443826582*^9, 3.9317594539576263`*^9}, {3.931765976850231*^9, 
   3.931765981879921*^9}, 3.931766325094534*^9, {3.931771477482258*^9, 
   3.9317715012478504`*^9}, 3.9317718408597984`*^9, 3.9666257266214294`*^9, {
   3.966625762946089*^9, 3.9666257757482033`*^9}, {3.9666269362883205`*^9, 
   3.9666269365353165`*^9}, {3.9772096545071354`*^9, 
   3.9772096711677074`*^9}, {3.977335464650997*^9, 3.977335471076271*^9}, {
   3.97754633709873*^9, 3.977546403612154*^9}, {3.9775468481231575`*^9, 
   3.9775468584734535`*^9}, {3.9775468989944134`*^9, 
   3.9775469230248737`*^9}, {3.977550373798399*^9, 3.977550377315895*^9}, {
   3.977557181056284*^9, 3.977557184740883*^9}, 3.977557447352001*^9, {
   3.977557592596981*^9, 3.9775575962889442`*^9}},
 FontSize->16,
 FontWeight->Bold,ExpressionUUID->"07222044-1f38-7f4c-a360-259283a30037"],

Cell["\<\
To efficiently detect convergence to a periodic steady state (limit cycle) \
under harmonic forcing, the system is integrated one forcing period at a time \
rather than over the full simulation horizon in a single call. After each \
period of duration T, the system state (or selected observables) is sampled \
at a fixed phase of the forcing cycle and compared to values obtained in \
previous periods.
This period-chunked integration strategy defines a discrete Poincar\[EAcute] \
map for the continuously forced system. By iterating this map, convergence to \
a limit cycle can be detected robustly while avoiding unnecessary long-time \
integration once periodic behavior has been established.
At each iteration, the final state of the previous period is used as the \
initial condition for the next, ensuring continuity of the trajectory. \
Convergence is declared when changes in the chosen convergence metric fall \
below prescribed tolerances for a specified number of consecutive periods. If \
convergence is not achieved within a maximum number of periods, the run is \
terminated and flagged as non-converged.
This approach allows stable and efficient simulation of stiff, nonlinear \
photosynthetic dynamics under oscillatory forcing, and provides a natural \
framework for extracting steady-period responses for further analysis.

Given: ODEs(t) already contain periodic forcing with period T (via Light[t,T])
k = 1: integrate from t0 = 0        to t1 = T        \[RightArrow] sample x1 \
\[TildeTilde] x(t1\[Minus]\[CurlyEpsilon])
k = 2: integrate from t0 = T        to t1 = 2T       \[RightArrow] sample x2 \
\[TildeTilde] x(t1\[Minus]\[CurlyEpsilon])
k = 3: integrate from t0 = 2T       to t1 = 3T       \[RightArrow] sample x3 \
\[TildeTilde] x(t1\[Minus]\[CurlyEpsilon])
...
Compare samples {xk} (or ChlF(xk)) across periods; stop when differences stay \
below tolerance for m consecutive steps.

Convergence tolerances (rtol, atol).\[LineSeparator]
Convergence is assessed by comparing successive Poincar\[EAcute] samples \
taken at the same phase of the forcing cycle. For each period, the difference \
between
consecutive samples is computed (Euclidean norm for state vectors, absolute \
difference for scalar metrics such as chlorophyll fluorescence).

A sample is considered converged if    |\[CapitalDelta]| \[LessEqual] atol + \
rtol |s|, where s is the magnitude of the current sample. The absolute \
tolerance atol
sets a minimum accuracy floor, while the relative tolerance rtol enforces \
scale-dependent accuracy for larger signals.

Convergence is declared only after this condition is satisfied for a \
specified number of consecutive periods (ConvWindow), ensuring robust \
detection of a
periodic steady state and avoiding false positives due to transient plateaus \
or numerical noise.

Progress diagnostics.
During period-chunked integration, convergence progress can be monitored by \
printing a dimensionless ratio defined as

    ratio = (difference between successive Poincar\[EAcute] samples) /  (atol \
+ rtol \[Times] sample magnitude).

This ratio is reported periodically when the option \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]PrintEvery\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] is set to a \
positive integer. Values much larger than 1 indicate the system is far from
convergence, values near 1 indicate proximity to the convergence threshold, \
and values below 1 indicate convergence for the current period.
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.977748488026388*^9, {3.9778085400360756`*^9, 3.977808548039343*^9}, {
   3.9778289095011806`*^9, 3.9778289213847847`*^9}, {3.977829251901907*^9, 
   3.977829336254463*^9}, {3.9778293780828667`*^9, 3.977829381545559*^9}, {
   3.977829849341284*^9, 3.9778298779496765`*^9}, 
   3.9778890206648026`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"fe3a74fe-3385-fe49-8e7f-\
73b10c5ae20f"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"RunByPeriods", ":", 
     RowBox[{
     "integrate", " ", "one", " ", "forcing", " ", "period", " ", "at", " ", 
      "a", " ", "time"}]}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"sample", " ", "the", " ", "Poincar\[EAcute]", " ", "map"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"stop", " ", "on", " ", 
     RowBox[{"state", "/", "ChlF"}], " ", "convergence"}]}], "*)"}], 
  "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "RunByPeriods", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"RunByPeriods", "[", 
      RowBox[{"ODEs_List", ",", "initCond_List", ",", 
       RowBox[{"T_", "?", "NumericQ"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"opts", ":", 
        RowBox[{"OptionsPattern", "[", "RunByPeriods", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"(*", 
         RowBox[{"state", " ", "variables"}], "*)"}], 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"vars", "=", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
           "PQ", ",", "PIox", ",", "Zea", ",", "PsbS", ",", "HL", ",", 
            "ATP"}], "}"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{"(*", "options", "*)"}], "maxP", ",", "m", ",", "rtol", ",", 
         "atol", ",", "keep", ",", "epsF", ",", "printEvery", ",", "metric", ",",
          "logDir", ",", "logFile", ",", "logEvery", ",", 
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{"(*", 
          RowBox[{"local", " ", 
           RowBox[{"helpers", "/", "state"}]}], "*)"}], 
         RowBox[{"rhsDebug", "=", "None"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"tag", "=", "\"\<RunByPeriodsFail\>\""}], ",", "L", ",", 
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{"(*", 
          RowBox[{"time", "/", "loop"}], "*)"}], 
         RowBox[{"t0", "=", "0."}], ",", "t1", ",", "eps", ",", "x0", ",", 
         "x1", ",", "sol", ",", "ics", ",", "initRules", ",", 
         RowBox[{"samples", "=", 
          RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"chunkSols", "=", 
          RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"chlFSamples", "=", 
          RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", "F1", ",", 
         RowBox[{"kConv", "=", 
          RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "\"\<NotConverged\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", "k", ",",
          "last", ",", "Tnow", ",", " ", "ndsolveOpts", ",", 
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{"(*", "diagnostics", "*)"}], "ok", ",", "PQv", ",", "Zeav", ",",
          "PsbSv", ",", "Lv", ",", 
         RowBox[{"lastRatio", "=", 
          RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "\"\<NA\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{"(*", "logging", "*)"}], "logDirResolved", ",", 
         "dateDirName", ",", "logPath", ",", 
         RowBox[{"stream", "=", "None"}], ",", "runID", ",", "nextRunFile", ",",
          "uniqueRunFile", ",", "openLog", ",", "writeLogRow", ",", 
         "emitDiag", ",", "computeDiag"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"(*", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"--", 
           RowBox[{"-", "option"}]}], " ", 
          RowBox[{"values", "--"}]}], "-"}], "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"maxP", "=", 
         RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<MaxPeriods\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"m", "=", 
         RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<ConvWindow\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"rtol", "=", 
         RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<rtol\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"atol", "=", 
         RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<atol\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"keep", "=", 
         RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<KeepChunkSols\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"epsF", "=", 
         RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<EndpointEpsFactor\>\"", "]"}]}], ";",
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"printEvery", "=", 
         RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<PrintEvery\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"metric", "=", 
         RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<ConvergenceMetric\>\"", "]"}]}], ";",
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"logDir", "=", 
         RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<LogDir\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"logFile", "=", 
         RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<LogFile\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"logEvery", "=", 
         RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<LogEvery\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"ndsolveOpts", "=", 
         RowBox[{"FilterRules", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Flatten", "@", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"opts", ",", 
              RowBox[{"Options", "[", "RunByPeriods", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"Options", "[", "NDSolve", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"Tnow", "=", "T"}], ";", "\n", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"(*", 
         RowBox[{"local", " ", "light", " ", "wrapper", " ", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
            "keeps", " ", "Tnow", " ", "explicit", " ", "and", " ", "sweep"}],
             "-", "safe"}], ")"}]}], "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"L", "[", 
          RowBox[{"tt_", "?", "NumericQ"}], "]"}], ":=", 
         RowBox[{"Light", "[", 
          RowBox[{"tt", ",", "Tnow"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"!", 
           RowBox[{"NumericQ", "[", 
            RowBox[{"L", "[", "t0", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Throw", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"<|", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"\"\<Success\>\"", "->", "False"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"\"\<FailAt\>\"", "->", "\"\<LightNotNumeric\>\""}], ",", 
