Cell["\<\
This subsection collects the first-harmonic frequency-response coefficients \
calculated for each forcing period in IV.1. The results are grouped by \
observable and exported as numerical tables and graphical representations of \
transfer-function magnitude and phase versus forcing period. Phase is \
expressed in radians in the exported tables and degrees in the plots.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  4.0012312533685207`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"3ab04694-2336-1545-8182-\
6f02dac9aaa9"],

